// # App Combat -- Military Combat Simulation
//
// Logline: Military combat simulation -- air-to-air, air-to-ground, missiles, formation flight, multi-generation dogfighting. Phase 3.4 reorg: moved from std/phys/weapons/ + std/phys/aero/ (military sim, not physics).
//
// Setup: Co-located module of 82 files under std/app/combat. Pure compute, no caps.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Aerodynamics and atmosphere family.
//   2. Attitude and navigation family.
//   3. Orbit, propulsion, TVC family.
//   4. Telemetry family.
//   5. Combat and formation family (gen4-gen7 multi-gen air combat).

